; RUN: dgtl-opt --pass=predication --filecheck %s
; Cross-Platform EOL Normalization Test
; This test validates that FileCheck works correctly with both
; Windows (CRLF: \r\n) and Unix (LF: \n) line endings.
; The tool normalizes all \r characters before processing.

op 0x06 0x00000001 0x00000000 0x00000000 0x00000000 0x0000
op 0x07 0x00000002 0x00000001 0x00000001 0x00000000 0x0000

; CHECK: DGTL IR Text Format
; CHECK-NEXT: Stream size:
; CHECK: Generated:
; CHECK: op 0x06
; CHECK-NEXT: op 0x07
; CHECK-NOT: FAILED
; CHECK-NOT: Windows
; CHECK-NOT: Unix
; CHECK: End of IR
